/-!
Formalization of the full corrected mixed-dimensional UPB upper bound.
Prior mathematical result: Chenhao Wang, arXiv:2609.05657v1, Theorem1.2,
with Alon-Lovasz, Chen-Johnston and Johnston antecedents as credited there.
This excludes bipartite systems with a qubit and all-qubit systems.
No novelty, cash-prize or original superseded-root closure is claimed.
