/-! Literal canonical complex UPBs for every non-balanced partner absorber.
The complete allocation dichotomy is discharged by proved graph covers. -/

noncomputable section
namespace P14AllPartnerUPB
open P14LargePartnerUPB
open P14ComplexLocalCover P14OddLayerLabels P14CanonicalUPBTransport
